      "description": "what do you want to do?",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_b150afc5",
      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "five individuals sitting on stairs",
      "description": "A diverse group of five smiling, athletic-looking individuals of varying ethnicities (Black, White, mixed-race) are seated on concrete stairs. They are dressed in casual athletic wear (hoodies, t-shirts, leggings, sneakers). Their poses are relaxed and confident, with some leaning on the railing or resting their arms. All are looking directly at the camera with positive expressions. The group composition includes two men and three women, with varied hair textures and styles (afro, dreadlocks, curly, short). They appear to be in good physical shape, suggesting an active or fitness-oriented lifestyle. The individuals are positioned across multiple steps, creating a layered, dynamic composition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_71ab19f2",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "motivational_group_pose",
      "label": "Group posing for motivational message",
      "description": "A diverse group of five individuals are seated on concrete stairs in a relaxed, confident manner, looking directly at the camera. Their athletic attire and positive expressions suggest a fitness-oriented, aspirational theme. The scene is overlaid with text posing motivational questions and answers, reinforcing the group's unified, goal-oriented energy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_492d4e57",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "motivational_meme_concept",
      "label": "Motivational Meme Concept",
      "description": "The meme format of posing motivational questions with immediate, action-oriented answers ('what do you want to do? win!!', 'when do you want to do it? now!') is a common internet trope used to inspire viewers to take immediate action toward their goals. This concept relies on the understanding of motivational psychology and popular internet culture trends.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8129bb5c",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "fitness_culture",
      "label": "Fitness Culture",
      "description": "The image and text reference a fitness-oriented lifestyle, which is a prevalent cultural phenomenon. The athletic attire and confident poses are associated with modern fitness culture, which often promotes self-improvement, discipline, and goal-setting. Understanding this cultural context helps interpret the aspirational tone of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_eb326b26",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "positive_self_affirmation",
      "label": "Positive Self-Affirmation",
      "description": "The meme uses positive self-affirmation techniques, which are psychological strategies to boost self-esteem and motivation. The phrases 'win!!' and 'now!' are designed to instill confidence and urgency, relying on the understanding of psychological principles related to goal-setting and self-motivation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_60f69e13",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "diversity_in_media_representation",
      "label": "Diversity in Media Representation",
      "description": "The image features a diverse group of individuals, which reflects contemporary efforts to promote diversity and inclusion in media. Understanding the significance of diverse representation in visual media helps contextualize the image as a positive, inclusive message, rather than a stereotypical portrayal.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6bb25ddf",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "athletic_ability_stereotype",
      "label": "Athletic Ability Stereotype",
      "description": "The image may implicitly reference the stereotype that athletic ability is the sole or primary measure of competence or success. While the individuals are portrayed positively, the meme could be interpreted as reinforcing the idea that physical fitness is a key component of achieving goals, which is a common but potentially reductive stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e77a2e6c",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "happiness",
      "label": "joyful and motivated emotion",
      "description": "The five individuals in the image are all smiling broadly and looking directly at the camera with confident, relaxed expressions. Their body language—leaning on railings, sitting comfortably, and maintaining eye contact—conveys a sense of contentment, positivity, and shared motivation. This collective expression of happiness is reinforced by the motivational text overlay, which encourages viewers to 'win!!' and act 'now!', aligning with their visibly upbeat demeanor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_9b576311",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The group of people is mapped as the embodiment of the answer to 'what do you want to do?'",
      "description": "The text 'what do you want to do? win!!' is positioned above the group. The group, composed of diverse, athletic, smiling individuals, visually represents the idealized 'winning' state or the successful outcome of pursuing goals. The mapping is implicit: the group's confident, fit, and positive demeanor is projected as the visual embodiment of the answer 'win!!'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1845e30f",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the motivational group as the ideal self",
      "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the group of five individuals sitting on the stairs. The text 'what do you want to do? win!!' and 'when do you want to do it? now!' frames the group as the embodiment of the successful, motivated self that the viewer is encouraged to become. The user is not directly addressed with 'you' or 'me', but the motivational structure and the aspirational visual of the group create a direct psychological projection: the viewer is invited to identify with the group's confidence, fitness, and goal-oriented mindset as their own desired state. The group serves as a visual model for the user's projected ideal self.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7030293e",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general motivational audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience seeking motivation and inspiration to take immediate action toward personal goals. The visual of diverse, fit, smiling individuals combined with the text 'what do you want to do? win!!' and 'when do you want to do it? now!' appeals to anyone looking for a positive, uplifting message to drive self-improvement and urgency. The lack of specific cultural, racial, or demographic markers suggests it targets a universal audience interested in self-motivation and fitness culture.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2aff9663"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    }
  ]
